Let $E = 2009^4 - 4 \times 2007^4 + 6 \times 2005^4 - 4 \times 2003^4 + 2001^4$.
Let $x = 2005$. Then $2009 = x+4$, $2007 = x+2$, $2003 = x-2$, and $2001 = x-4$.
So
\begin{align*} E &= (x+4)^4 - 4(x+2)^4 + 6(x)^4 - 4(x-2)^4 + (x-4)^4 \\ &= (x^4 + 16x^3 + 96x^2 + 256x + 256) - 4(x^4 + 8x^3 + 24x^2 + 32x + 16) \\ &+ 6x^4 - 4(x^4 - 8x^3 + 24x^2 - 32x + 16) + (x^4 - 16x^3 + 96x^2 - 256x + 256) \\ &= x^4 + 16x^3 + 96x^2 + 256x + 256 - 4x^4 - 32x^3 - 96x^2 - 128x - 64 \\ &+ 6x^4 - 4x^4 + 32x^3 - 96x^2 + 128x - 64 + x^4 - 16x^3 + 96x^2 - 256x + 256 \\ &= (1 - 4 + 6 - 4 + 1)x^4 + (16 - 32 + 32 - 16)x^3 + (96 - 96 - 96 + 96)x^2 + (256 - 128 + 128 - 256)x + (256 - 64 - 64 + 256) \\ &= (1 - 4 + 6 - 4 + 1)x^4 + (16 - 32 + 32 - 16)x^3 + (96 - 96 - 96 + 96)x^2 + (256 - 128 + 128 - 256)x + (256 - 64 - 64 + 256) \\ &= (1 - 4 + 6 - 4 + 1)x^4 + (16-32+32-16)x^3 + (96-96-96+96)x^2 + (256-128+128-256)x + (256-64-64+256) \\ &= (1+6+1 - 4 - 4)x^4 + (16-32+32-16)x^3 + (96-96-96+96)x^2 + (256-128+128-256)x + (256-64-64+256) \\ &= (8 - 8)x^4 + (16 - 32 + 32 - 16)x^3 + (96 - 96 - 96 + 96)x^2 + (256 - 128 + 128 - 256)x + (256 - 64 - 64 + 256) \\ &= 0x^4 + 0x^3 + 0x^2 + 0x + (256 - 128 - 64 + 256) \\ &= 256 - 128 - 64 + 256 \\ &= 128 - 64 + 256 \\ &= 64 + 256 \\ &= 320\end{aligned}
Therefore, $E = 320$.

